sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Dealer (Next.js)
  participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
  participant AS as Auction Service
  participant R as Redis
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  actor O as Other Bidders
  D->>WS: CONNECT wss://…/auctions/{id} (JWT)
  WS->>AS: verify token, tenant, role = DEALER
  AS->>R: GET auction:{id}:state
  R-->>AS: highest bid, end time
  AS-->>D: AUCTION_STATE
  D->>WS: PLACE_BID {auctionId, amount, clientTs}
  WS->>AS: forward bid
  AS->>R: EVALSHA place_bid.lua (atomic check-and-set)
  alt bid valid and highest
    R-->>AS: ACCEPTED (new highest, seq no.)
    AS-)PG: async insert into bids (audit log)
    AS-->>D: BID_ACCEPTED
    AS-->>O: NEW_HIGHEST_BID broadcast
  else too low / closed / duplicate
    R-->>AS: REJECTED (reason)
    AS-->>D: BID_REJECTED {reason}
  end
  Note over AS,R: Steps 7–9 (server-side bid processing) must complete in < 15 ms (p99)
